---
// Verbatim Authentic Content & Media from Khao Sok Riverside Cottages
import PageLayout from '../../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
import DualVideoPlayer from '../../components/DualVideoPlayer.astro';

---

<PageLayout
  title="Khao Sok Thailand Culture"
  description="Immerse yourself in Thailand culture through village visits, jungle cooking classes, Thai massages, and hot spring experiences."
  heroImage="/wp-content/uploads/2016/08/packages-call-to-action.jpg"
  heroTitle="Khao Sok Thailand Culture"
  heroSubtitle="The Ancient Rainforest of Southern Thailand"
  breadcrumbs={[{"label": "Khao Sok Thailand Culture", "href": "/khao-sok-thailand-culture/"}]}
>
  <article class="max-w-4xl mx-auto space-y-10">
    <div class="bg-[#faf8f5]/95 border border-[#12281b]/10 rounded-3xl p-4 sm:p-8 md:p-12 shadow-2xl backdrop-blur-md">
      
      <div class="flex items-center justify-between border-b border-[#12281b]/10 pb-4 mb-8 font-sans text-[11px] tracking-[0.2em] font-medium uppercase text-[#163824]">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 font-semibold">
          <span class="text-[#7a5813]">KSR</span>
          <span class="text-[#12281b]/20">/</span>
          <span>FIELD DISPATCH</span>
        </div>
        <span class="text-[#7a5813] font-bold">KHAO SOK · THAILAND</span>
      </div>

      <div class="space-y-6 text-[#223e2c] text-base sm:text-lg leading-relaxed font-normal">

        <ul class="space-y-3 my-6 pl-2">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-[#223e2c] text-base leading-relaxed">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#7a5813]/70 mt-2.5 flex-shrink-0"></span>
            <span><a href="#cooking" class="awb-menu__main-a awb-menu__main-a_button"><span class="menu-text fusion-button button-default button-small">Cooking</span></a></span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-[#223e2c] text-base leading-relaxed">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#7a5813]/70 mt-2.5 flex-shrink-0"></span>
            <span><a href="#massage" class="awb-menu__main-a awb-menu__main-a_button"><span class="menu-text fusion-button button-default button-small">Massage</span></a></span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-[#223e2c] text-base leading-relaxed">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#7a5813]/70 mt-2.5 flex-shrink-0"></span>
            <span><a href="#hotsprings" class="awb-menu__main-a awb-menu__main-a_button"><span class="menu-text fusion-button button-default button-small">Hot Springs</span></a></span>
          </li>
        </ul>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#163824] font-semibold tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-[#12281b]/10">
          <span>Thai Culture Experiences in Khao Sok</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          Experience Thailand culture at it’s finest with these three activities. Are you a big fan of Thai cuisine? If so, you can opt for a Thai Jungle-Cooking class at a local organic farm. Alternately, you can pamper yourself with a traditional Thai massage or a visit to the nearby Hot Springs.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          Make your dreams come true when you <a href="/booking-khao-sok-accommodation/" class="text-[#1b432c] underline decoration-[#ba9038]/60 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-[#ba9038] hover:text-[#7a5813] transition-colors">book a room</a> or <a href="/khao-sok-tour-packages/" class="text-[#1b432c] underline decoration-[#ba9038]/60 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-[#ba9038] hover:text-[#7a5813] transition-colors">tour package</a>.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          <em>NOTE: Prices shown are per person</em>
        </p>
        <h3 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#163824] font-semibold tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-[#12281b]/10">
          <span>How to plan your stay</span>
        </h3>
        <ul class="space-y-3 my-6 pl-2">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-[#223e2c] text-base leading-relaxed">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#7a5813]/70 mt-2.5 flex-shrink-0"></span>
            <span>Choose a <a href="/khao-sok-tour-packages/" class="text-[#1b432c] underline decoration-[#ba9038]/60 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-[#ba9038] hover:text-[#7a5813] transition-colors">Package</a> with a set program for best value</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-[#223e2c] text-base leading-relaxed">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#7a5813]/70 mt-2.5 flex-shrink-0"></span>
            <span>Or click the 'Plan Your Stay' buttons to create your own experiences.</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#163824] font-semibold tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-[#12281b]/10">
          <span>Jungle Farm Thai Cooking</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          Real Thai Cooking – Naturally<br /> Authentic Thai cooking in a relaxed, beautiful farm setting.<br /> Harvest fresh local ingredients from our Thai organic farm and prepare traditional Thai recipes, guided by friendly local chefs. Enjoy a hands-on farm-to-table experience that is personal, informative, and fun.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          6 Individual Cooking Stations
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          <strong>Duration:</strong> 2-3 hours
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          <strong>Price Per Person:</strong> 1,500 THB
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          <i class="fb-icon-element-1 fb-icon-element fontawesome-icon fa-info fas circle-no fusion-text-flow" style="--awb-iconcolor:var(--awb-color7);--awb-iconcolor-hover:var(--awb-color7);--awb-font-size:20px;--awb-margin-right:10px;"></i> Explore | Learn | Harvest | Cook | Taste | Enjoy
        </p>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#163824] font-semibold tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-[#12281b]/10">
          <span>Thailand Culture – Massage</span>
        </h2>
        <DualVideoPlayer
          landscapeSrc="https://www.youtube.com/embed/crW39GTubV0?rel=0"
          shortSrc="https://www.youtube.com/embed/1VRgvD05P_8?rel=0"
          caption="Thai Massage Experience"
        />
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          <span>We have a beautiful open-air massage room by the river. It is a soothing way to unwind in the jungle. Our trained masseuses offer a choice of relaxing oil massage or traditional Thai style massage. Massage is an integral part of Thai culture. Learn more about the <a href="https://www.medicalnewstoday.com/articles/323687" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-[#1b432c] underline decoration-[#ba9038]/60 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-[#ba9038] hover:text-[#7a5813] transition-colors">potential health benefits of Thai massage</a>.</span>
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          <strong>Duration:</strong> One hour
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          <strong>Price Per Person:</strong> 600 THB
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          <i class="fb-icon-element-2 fb-icon-element fontawesome-icon fa-info fas circle-no fusion-text-flow" style="--awb-iconcolor:var(--awb-color7);--awb-iconcolor-hover:var(--awb-color7);--awb-font-size:20px;--awb-margin-right:10px;"></i>We recommend traditional Thai-style massage – it improves circulation.
        </p>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#163824] font-semibold tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-[#12281b]/10">
          <span>Khao Sok Hot Springs</span>
        </h2>
        <DualVideoPlayer
          landscapeSrc="https://www.youtube.com/embed/33MAMT57XqY?rel=0"
          shortSrc="https://www.youtube.com/embed/2MZHBTJ_V68?rel=0"
          caption="Khao Sok Hot Springs"
        />
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          Looking for total relaxation? The naturally heated water pours from the springs into tiled pools where you can sit and relax. With a clean, modern style, the hot springs are a popular place for locals, so you get a taste of Thailand culture. The 15 minute drive from our resort includes a stop at a viewpoint with a dramatic vista of the Khao Sok valley.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          <strong>Duration:</strong> 1.5-2 hours
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          <strong>Price Per Person:</strong> 650 THB for 2 people, 500 THB for 3+ people
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          <i class="fb-icon-element-3 fb-icon-element fontawesome-icon fa-info fas circle-no fusion-text-flow" style="--awb-iconcolor:var(--awb-color7);--awb-iconcolor-hover:var(--awb-color7);--awb-font-size:20px;--awb-margin-right:10px;"></i>The hot springs are popular with locals, so respect Thailand culture by wearing shorts and a shirt instead of a bikini.
        </p>
        <figure class="my-10 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-xl border border-[#12281b]/10 bg-white/50">
          <img
            src="/wp-content/uploads/2016/08/packages-call-to-action.jpg"
            alt="Enjoying Khao Sok lake"
            class="w-full h-52 sm:h-72 md:h-80 object-cover object-center"
            loading="lazy"
            decoding="async"
           width="1200" height="800" />
          <figcaption class="p-3.5 text-xs text-[#255038] font-serif italic border-t border-[#12281b]/10 bg-[#f4efeb]/60">Enjoying Khao Sok lake</figcaption>
        </figure>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          To find<br /> the best ways<br /> to enjoy these activities
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          Please visit our packages page.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          To find<br /> the best ways<br /> to enjoy these activities
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          Please visit our packages page.
        </p>
        <div class="my-12">
          <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-4">
            <figure class="rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-lg border border-[#12281b]/10 bg-white/50 group">
              <img
                src="/wp-content/uploads/2016/07/experience-thai-culture-1.jpg"
                alt=""
                class="w-full h-48 sm:h-64 object-cover object-center group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-300"
                loading="lazy"
                decoding="async"
               width="1200" height="800" />
              
            </figure>
            <figure class="rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-lg border border-[#12281b]/10 bg-white/50 group">
              <img
                src="/wp-content/uploads/2016/07/experience-thai-culture-2.jpg"
                alt=""
                class="w-full h-48 sm:h-64 object-cover object-center group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-300"
                loading="lazy"
                decoding="async"
               width="1200" height="800" />
              
            </figure>
            <figure class="rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-lg border border-[#12281b]/10 bg-white/50 group">
              <img
                src="/wp-content/uploads/2016/07/experience-thai-culture-3.jpg"
                alt=""
                class="w-full h-48 sm:h-64 object-cover object-center group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-300"
                loading="lazy"
                decoding="async"
               width="1200" height="800" />
              
            </figure>
            <figure class="rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-lg border border-[#12281b]/10 bg-white/50 group">
              <img
                src="/wp-content/uploads/2022/05/jungle-cooking-exeperience-2.jpg"
                alt=""
                class="w-full h-48 sm:h-64 object-cover object-center group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-300"
                loading="lazy"
                decoding="async"
               width="1200" height="800" />
              
            </figure>
            <figure class="rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-lg border border-[#12281b]/10 bg-white/50 group">
              <img
                src="/wp-content/uploads/2016/07/experience-thai-culture-5.jpg"
                alt=""
                class="w-full h-48 sm:h-64 object-cover object-center group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-300"
                loading="lazy"
                decoding="async"
               width="1200" height="800" />
              
            </figure>
            <figure class="rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-lg border border-[#12281b]/10 bg-white/50 group">
              <img
                src="/wp-content/uploads/2016/07/experience-thai-culture-6.jpg"
                alt=""
                class="w-full h-48 sm:h-64 object-cover object-center group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-300"
                loading="lazy"
                decoding="async"
               width="1200" height="800" />
              
            </figure>
            <figure class="rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-lg border border-[#12281b]/10 bg-white/50 group">
              <img
                src="/wp-content/uploads/2016/07/experience-thai-culture-8.jpg"
                alt=""
                class="w-full h-48 sm:h-64 object-cover object-center group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-300"
                loading="lazy"
                decoding="async"
               width="1200" height="800" />
              
            </figure>
            <figure class="rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-lg border border-[#12281b]/10 bg-white/50 group">
              <img
                src="/wp-content/uploads/2016/07/experience-thai-culture-9.jpg"
                alt=""
                class="w-full h-48 sm:h-64 object-cover object-center group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-300"
                loading="lazy"
                decoding="async"
               width="1200" height="800" />
              
            </figure>
            <figure class="rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-lg border border-[#12281b]/10 bg-white/50 group">
              <img
                src="/wp-content/uploads/2016/07/experience-thai-culture-10.jpg"
                alt=""
                class="w-full h-48 sm:h-64 object-cover object-center group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-300"
                loading="lazy"
                decoding="async"
               width="1200" height="800" />
              
            </figure>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      
    </div>
  </article>
</PageLayout>
